{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Lumiclipia 是一款為 iPhone、iPad 與 Mac 而設的影片剪輯工具，適合想快速完成旅遊回顧、社交貼文、家庭片段或產品影片的創作者。它以免費下載形式提供，內置專業風格的多軌時間軸與即時預覽，讓整個剪輯流程保持順暢。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>多軌時間軸即時預覽剪輯</h2>\n<p>Lumiclipia 以多軌時間軸為核心，支援精準修剪與片段排列，可加入多條音軌及波形顯示，方便對準節拍。剪輯期間可即時預覽，內置穩定化能把手持拍攝的晃動畫面變得平順，並提供 Crossfade 等轉場效果、音量控制與淡入淡出，另有批量編輯、標記、標誌浮水印及合併工具。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-63-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-64-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-65-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-66-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-67-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Lumiclipia</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T18:19:07.289667+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}